+ *          bit 7    LATCH_TO_VP
+ *          bit 6    EVENT_STAT_SEL
+ *          bits 5:0 HS_DETECT_LEVEL, the comparator threshold
+ * 0x1B78 Detect Status 2
+ *          bit 1    HSBIAS_IN, the comparator output
