+// bits of 0x1b75 (LATCH_TO_VP, EVENT_STAT_SEL) as they were.
+/*
+ * Binary search for the HS_DETECT_LEVEL at which the comparator changes state.
+ * The comparator output is monotonic in the threshold, so two reference reads
+ * at the ends tell us which way round it is and the search does not have to
+ * assume a polarity. 8 probes total, no power transitions, ~3 ms.
+ *
+ * Returns the trip level 0x00..0x3f, or -1 if the comparator did not move
+ * across the whole range (nothing pressed, or the detector is not powered).
